  "about": {
    "description": "The Crab Trap is a waterfront seafood restaurant with three locations along the Florida panhandle offering beautiful views of the Gulf of Mexico and fresh local seafood. The restaurant operates its own wild fish processing facility called the Seafood Commissary, which prepares over 250,000 lbs of fresh-caught Gulf seafood annually including shrimp, grouper, snapper, mahi-mahi, cobia, wahoo, and amberjack.",
